Stanford Bunny mesh (bun_zipper_res2.ply)

This file is a decimated reconstruction from the Stanford 3D Scanning
Repository. It is not covered by the CC0 dedication in the repository
LICENSE.

Source: Stanford University Computer Graphics Laboratory
URL: https://graphics.stanford.edu/data/3Dscanrep/
Scan: Cyberware 3030 MS, 1994, reconstructed with zipper
Reference: Turk, G. and Levoy, M. "Zippered Polygon Meshes from Range
Images." Proceedings of SIGGRAPH '94, ACM, pp. 311-318, 1994.

